<title>USA: Allied Products sets split, raises div.</title>
<headline>Allied Products sets split, raises div.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allied Products Corp said Thursday its directors had approved a three-for-two stock split, payable September 5, record August 15.</p>
<p>In addition, directors approved a quarterly dividend of $0.04 a share, payable September 30, record August 15. This represents a 20 percent dividend increase on post-spplit shares.</p>
<p>Allied Products makes largemetal stamping presses, agricultural equipment, and supplies thermoplastic compounds and additives.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
